# Release check for tiny-py-lib

Dependencies are installed with `pip install -r requirements.txt` and the tests run with `python -m pytest`.
See the [testing guide](https://docs.pytest.org/) and the [contributing notes](https://github.com/steplet-corpus/tiny-py-lib/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).

Report the summary line exactly as printed.
